    "detailed_description": "Tokyo Stories is a 3D adventure game featuring a visual expression that combines pixel art and 3D.<br>A girl wanders through a vanishing Tokyo in search of her best friend who suddenly disappeared without a trace.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/5dddf284c12c5ed25e587b12fcfe6d14.poster.avif?t=1686992713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/5dddf284c12c5ed25e587b12fcfe6d14.webm?t=1686992713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/5dddf284c12c5ed25e587b12fcfe6d14.mp4?t=1686992713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/6ea80560f3bf1d3d59ffa43625b4715a.poster.avif?t=1686992713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/6ea80560f3bf1d3d59ffa43625b4715a.webm?t=1686992713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/6ea80560f3bf1d3d59ffa43625b4715a.mp4?t=1686992713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;The city continues to tell her story, even after her disappearance.&quot;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/f32ef9b61161a2384cb8e6e0b5b195ff.poster.avif?t=1686992713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/f32ef9b61161a2384cb8e6e0b5b195ff.webm?t=1686992713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com