hat features visual expression that combines pixel art and 3D.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/dfb019c8e6b76a607e22d992ecf146f9.avif?t=1686992713\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/0bfc05af252f4bd1bbec01452249cb44.avif?t=1686992713\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251970/extras/69ffa87b6c004f2528a0ff5952a2e830.avif?t=1686992713\" /></span><br><br>Add to your Wishlist and follow up on upcoming development updates!",
